{"type":"text","timestamp":1790375852171,"sessionID":"ses_f254c5965ffe7kqk7x65zPgWlx","part":{"id":"prt_0dab77872001oW2tbTiLNx9zg0","messageID":"msg_0dab74edf001uUFz31uk0MkysP","sessionID":"ses_f254c5965ffe7kqk7x65zPgWlx","type":"text","text":"Implemented the fleet radar target acquisition setup.\n\nChanges made:\n\n- Added `UnitStats.TARGET` mapping in [unit_stats.gd](/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd:6).\n- Created [detect_range.gd](/workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd:1) with:\n  - Configurable collision shape, base range, and stats.\n  - Team-based collision layers and masks.\n  - Dynamic `CircleShape2D` radius based on attack range.\n- Created [target_finder.gd](/workspace/custom_nodes/target_finder.gd:1) with:\n  - Target range tracking.\n  - Entry and exit signals.\n  - Type filtering for `BattleUnit`.\n  - Closest opposing target selection.\n  - `has_target_in_range()`.\n- Updated [battle_unit.gd](/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd:4) to expose and connect `DetectRange` and `TargetFinder`.\n- Updated [battle_unit.tscn](/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn:1) with the radar area, collision shape, and target finder node.\n\nValidation completed with Godot 4.4.1:\n\n- Project imported and launched successfully.\n- Runtime checks passed for collision filtering, radar sizing, target selection, range entry and exit signals, non-unit filtering, empty fleets, and stat reassignment.\n- Captured collision visualization confirmed the player radar overlaps the nearby enemy and excludes the distant enemy.","time":{"start":1790375852146,"end":1790375852150},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0fbdbffde444c1e1016ab6f7a425ec87d28019d988a3b899bf","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
